      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(Vingan catches one of the pigeons, brings it close to his face and admires it—then tosses it up and lets it fly. Carried by the force of the throw, the flying pigeon scratches with its claw the forehead of Uma, who is arriving wearing cooling glasses. She pushes the pigeon away and feels her forehead.)"
      }
